                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A weird little relic. You play a clumsy devil crawling through mazes and minigames that make almost no sense until you just accept the chaos. Controls feel like they were designed for a joystick from another decade, because they were, and the humor is dumb in the best way. \nIt's clunky, it's ugly in places, and it's absolutely charming. Not for everyone, but if you grew up on this kind of nonsense you'll grin the whole way through.",
